[{"id":5227189324,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN5CUTA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally with the MRP of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123325, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nWith **Bake Navigation** enabled on the GridMap node, and visible collision shapes + visible navigation:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"534\" height=\"269\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97f71747-1817-4b3f-a8de-66315e49a4ee\" />\r\n\r\nI'll take care to document this in the manual when this is merged.\r\n\r\nPS: When testing this PR, I also realized we don't have OccluderInstance3D baking support for GridMap (similar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2910). Since GridMap has no dedicated slot for occluders like it does for collision and navigation, baking an occluder would naturally seem like the way to go. Also, a single merged occluder should perform better than thousands of individual occluder instances.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/p